{"Admin group member list template loops over {{each member in members}}, but admin_group_route.setupController no longer assigns controller.members and findMembers() only updates model.members, causing the admin member list to not render": 0.7375608086585999, "totalPages() uses Math.floor(user_count / limit) + 1, which overcounts when the member count is exactly divisible by the page size, leaving the pager enabled for a nonexistent extra page and triggering redundant requests": 0.859366774559021, "Public group members template changed from {{#each m in model}} to {{#each m in members}}, but the route no longer sets a members controller property, causing the page to iterate over an undefined property and render no rows": 0.8316912055015564, "POST /admin/groups no longer accepts params[:group][:usernames] for creating groups with initial members, breaking the existing admin UI/API path and the previous group.usernames contract": 0.6397204399108887, "Add/remove member routes are collection-style paths while the controller requires a group_id parameter, causing callers to redundantly supply the group id and raising ActionController::ParameterMissing on omission": 0.6556459069252014, "Removal endpoint depends on user_id in the request body, making the endpoint contract fragile for clients expecting the previous update flow": 0.16472788155078888, "Group members action returns paginated member data for any group name without calling guardian.ensure_can_see! or checking requester authorization, allowing attackers to query private group membership": 0.1299060583114624, "Template uses {{avatar member ...}} and {{member.username}}, but the itemView pattern passes the current item as view context not as a member property, likely causing blank/avatar rendering errors": 0.4938698410987854}